{
    "title": "Voice Recorder & Voice Memos",
    "description": "Looking for a free, high-quality & easy-to-use voice recorder? \r\nTry Voice Recorder & Voice Memos! Created by a top development team, this audio recorder can <b>easily record any sound</b> with one click. No recording time limit! <b>High-quality</b> sound reproduction.\r\n\r\nIt is a powerful Android audio recorder <b>for all scenes</b>, whether you want to record meetings, make voice memo or capture music inspiration, this sound recorder will give you a hand!\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2728Record sound in high quality\r\n\u27285 preset recording modes, customizable sample rate & bit rate\r\n\u2728Auto back up recordings to Google Drive\r\n\u2728Support internal recording, record your phone's internal sound\r\n\u2728Noise suppression, echo cancellation, automatic gain control\r\n\u2728Quick record from notification center or widget\r\n\u2728Support stereo and mono recording\r\n\u2728Add marks while recording, fast locate key points\r\n\u2728Add tag to your recording, easy to categorize\r\n\u2728Support background & screen off recording\r\n\u2728Save recordings to SD card\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd2<b>Meetings & Lectures Mode</b>\r\nRunning out of time to take notes during a meeting or lecture? Try this convenient sound recorder! Easily record voice notes without noise. It supports adding markers while recording to quickly locate important moments during playback. And you can sort recordings by name, time, size and duration. Improve your efficiency with this audio recorder!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5<b>Music & Raw Sound Mode</b>\r\nThis professional audio recorder helps you quickly record music in CD quality when inspiration strikes. You can easily re-record from anywhere you're not satisfied. It supports stereo and mono recording, and allows you to customize the sample rate and bit rate. Start a song recording now!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfb<b>Standard Mode</b>\r\nStandard mode is suitable for most scenarios. You can use it as a common voice memo to record lectures, interviews, speeches, sleep talk or others. Having one audio recorder unlocks multiple usages, try it!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2<b>Internal Recording Mode</b>\r\nWhether you want to record game sounds, music, or online meetings, our internal recording mode covers all your needs. It supports recording only the internal sounds from your phone to avoid external noise or capturing both internal sounds and microphone input to meet different requirements. Your recordings are stored only locally, ensuring 100% safety and peace of mind.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89Other details:\r\n\u2726Switchable microphone;\r\n\u2726Support multiple formats recordings (.wav,.m4a,.mp3, etc.);\r\n\u2726Automatically pause the recording when there is a call;\r\n\u2726Play at different speeds, fast forward/rewind;\r\n\u2726Easily trim or cut recordings;\r\n\u2726Centrally manage recordings in one place;\r\n\u2726Rename, share or set as ringtone;\r\n\u2726Call recording is not supported.\r\n\r\n\r\nNo more searching for a sound recorder, Voice Recorder & Voice Memos help you record voice easily! It's not just a voice memo app, but a powerful tape recorder and lecture recorder to record any memorable sound in your life. Just press record button to quickly record audio, come and try it!\r\n\r\n\r\nYour feedback and suggestions are always welcome! If you have any questions, please contact us at urecorderfeedback@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a free, high-quality &amp; easy-to-use voice recorder? <br>Try Voice Recorder &amp; Voice Memos! Created by a top development team, this audio recorder can <b>easily record any sound</b> with one click. No recording time limit! <b>High-quality</b> sound reproduction.<br><br>It is a powerful Android audio recorder <b>for all scenes</b>, whether you want to record meetings, make voice memo or capture music inspiration, this sound recorder will give you a hand!<br><br><br>Features:<br>\u2728Record sound in high quality<br>\u27285 preset recording modes, customizable sample rate &amp; bit rate<br>\u2728Auto back up recordings to Google Drive<br>\u2728Support internal recording, record your phone&#39;s internal sound<br>\u2728Noise suppression, echo cancellation, automatic gain control<br>\u2728Quick record from notification center or widget<br>\u2728Support stereo and mono recording<br>\u2728Add marks while recording, fast locate key points<br>\u2728Add tag to your recording, easy to categorize<br>\u2728Support background &amp; screen off recording<br>\u2728Save recordings to SD card<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcd2<b>Meetings &amp; Lectures Mode</b><br>Running out of time to take notes during a meeting or lecture? Try this convenient sound recorder! Easily record voice notes without noise. It supports adding markers while recording to quickly locate important moments during playback. And you can sort recordings by name, time, size and duration. Improve your efficiency with this audio recorder!<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfb5<b>Music &amp; Raw Sound Mode</b><br>This professional audio recorder helps you quickly record music in CD quality when inspiration strikes. You can easily re-record from anywhere you&#39;re not satisfied. It supports stereo and mono recording, and allows you to customize the sample rate and bit rate. Start a song recording now!<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcfb<b>Standard Mode</b><br>Standard mode is suitable for most scenarios. You can use it as a common voice memo to record lectures, interviews, speeches, sleep talk or others. Having one audio recorder unlocks multiple usages, try it!<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcf2<b>Internal Recording Mode</b><br>Whether you want to record game sounds, music, or online meetings, our internal recording mode covers all your needs. It supports recording only the internal sounds from your phone to avoid external noise or capturing both internal sounds and microphone input to meet different requirements. Your recordings are stored only locally, ensuring 100% safety and peace of mind.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf89Other details:<br>\u2726Switchable microphone;<br>\u2726Support multiple formats recordings (.wav,.m4a,.mp3, etc.);<br>\u2726Automatically pause the recording when there is a call;<br>\u2726Play at different speeds, fast forward/rewind;<br>\u2726Easily trim or cut recordings;<br>\u2726Centrally manage recordings in one place;<br>\u2726Rename, share or set as ringtone;<br>\u2726Call recording is not supported.<br><br><br>No more searching for a sound recorder, Voice Recorder &amp; Voice Memos help you record voice easily! It&#39;s not just a voice memo app, but a powerful tape recorder and lecture recorder to record any memorable sound in your life. Just press record button to quickly record audio, come and try it!<br><br><br>Your feedback and suggestions are always welcome! If you have any questions, please contact us at urecorderfeedback@gmail.com.",
